/*
  DensityToggle.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0153 · DensityToggle (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface — the native peers of the web `t(key, default)`
  keys in `components/forms/DensityToggle.tsx`. Every key/fallback pair below is byte-identical to the web
  source so the selector reads the same on both platforms.

  These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept
  in a per-surface table ("DensityToggle") so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings. In test /
  preview bundles `NSLocalizedString` returns the value below, keeping the labels deterministic.
*/

/* --- Web `t()` keys (verbatim from components/forms/DensityToggle.tsx) --- */

/* The dense spreadsheet layout option (web `density.table`). */
"density.table" = "Table";

/* The reduced-padding layout option (web `density.compact`). */
"density.compact" = "Compact";

/* The roomy default layout option (web `density.comfortable`). */
"density.comfortable" = "Comfortable";

/* The radiogroup's default accessible name (web `density.groupLabel`). */
"density.groupLabel" = "List density";

/* --- Native a11y addition (no blank box — see the empty-options branch) --- */

/* Friendly body shown when no options are supplied, so the surface never renders a bare box. The web
   simply maps over an empty option list; the native HIG calls for a labelled empty state. */
"densityToggle.empty" = "No density options";
